# Pull the list from lab-mail into ~/mail/claude@p7x.dev.
#
# lab-mail serves it on loopback, and any login but the ones that may
# write it reads it with any password, so the password here is a
# placeholder. claude@p7x.dev cannot change the list, so the sync
# only pulls, and Expunge Near drops what has gone from lab-mail.

IMAPAccount lab-mail
Host 127.0.0.1
Port 2143
TLSType None
AuthMechs LOGIN
User claude@p7x.dev
Pass lab-mail

IMAPStore lab-mail
Account lab-mail

MaildirStore local
Path ~/mail/claude@p7x.dev/
Inbox ~/mail/claude@p7x.dev/INBOX

Channel lab-mail
Far :lab-mail:
Near :local:
Patterns INBOX Next Later Archive
Create Near
Sync Pull
Expunge Near
Remove None
CopyArrivalDate yes
